# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): a band with no table has no row or version whose span isn't always (L §4.3), as an input
# with no row (L4_3_input_no_rows): read with no law date it has no candidate, and "Read with no law date ..., the
# question ends at no value" (L §4.6 step 5, "For an input or a band"; §8.1): `rate: no value` (q), `krate at lo:
# no value` (q2, keyed, no time key); with law, `no value at <law date>` (q3).
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"

input age: int
band rate(a: int): money PLN
band krate[k in [lo, hi]](a: int): money PLN
def r[m in months]: money PLN = rate(age)
ask q: r[2027-05]
ask q2: krate[lo](age)
ask q3: rate(age) law 2027-05-01

version v_act
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age = 3 "the age"
=== expect
q: ?"rate: no value" (rate)
  cut 2027-12-31
q2: ?"krate at lo: no value" (krate[lo])
  cut 2027-12-31
q3: ?"rate: no value at 2027-05-01" (rate)
  law date 2027-05-01, cut 2027-12-31
